                "text": "That's a fascinating project!  \n\nTo help me budget it out, tell me a little more about it. For example:\n\n* **What are the main components of the project?** (e.g., data collection, model training, software development)\n* **What resources will you need?** (e.g., computing power, data storage, software licenses)\n* **What is your estimated timeline for the project?** \n* **Do you have any existing budget in mind?**\n\nThe more details you can give me, the more accurate and helpful my budget estimate will be.  \n",
